{
  "manualGuideTitle": "User guide",
  "manualPrepareTitle": "Set up participants",
  "manualPrepareItem1": "In Members, register each player’s name, reading and gender, then turn on participation for today’s attendees. Use the menu at the top right to import or export CSV or JSON.",
  "manualPrepareItem2": "For childcare or similar needs, edit a player and select their partner under the simultaneous play restriction. Automatic generation keeps them from playing in the same round.",
  "manualPrepareItem3": "In the player’s menu, choose 一時休み for a one-round break or 早退 to sit out all remaining rounds.",
  "manualGenerateTitle": "Generate a round",
  "manualGenerateItem1": "In Match History, tap 最初の試合を作成 to create the first round. Use + for the next round or the refresh icon to regenerate the displayed round.",
  "manualGenerateItem2": "Choose 自動 for suggested formats based on the court count, or 手動 to pick each court’s format. Tap スタート and check the court assignments and players on break.",
  "manualGenerateItem3": "If the same players would play again, a prompt may appear. Keep the current rest rule or review how many players would sit out and for how long before allowing a one-round exception.",
  "manualSwapTitle": "Swap players manually",
  "manualSwapItem1": "Long-press the first player in the displayed round or select them via 選手を入れ替える. Then tap the other player.",
  "manualSwapItem2": "For example, swap an injured player with someone on break. Organizers can make manual exceptions to match formats and simultaneous play restrictions.",
  "manualSwapItem3": "Tap 終了 to exit swap mode before selecting the second player. To undo the most recent action after a swap, tap the undo icon at the top and confirm with 戻す.",
  "manualTroubleshootTitle": "When a round cannot be generated",
  "manualTroubleshootItem1": "If the app reports a shortage, check today’s participants and who is on a break or has left. Reduce the number of courts or adjust the match formats.",
  "manualTroubleshootItem2": "If a simultaneous play restriction prevents generation, adjust the court count or formats so one player in the pair can sit out.",
  "manualExpenseTitle": "Settle practice expenses",
  "manualExpenseItem1": "In Expenses, use 出費を追加 to enter court fees and equipment costs. Select supplies from inventory or enter the unit price and quantity used.",
  "manualExpenseItem2": "Tap an expense to set who paid it. To assign expenses to different groups, select 男女 and set the group on each expense.",
  "manualExpenseItem3": "Use 支払調整 to review the amount per person, balance and advances. If you entered equipment usage, check the date and tap 支払確定・記録を保存 to save the usage record.",
